    Socket::waitForHttp2StreamFlushed() and Socket::waitForQuicClientStreamFlushed() (issue #6001): without a
    session they raise an error.  The HTTP/2 wait is tested with a session through the WebSocket client in
    examples/test/qlib/WebSocketClient/WebSocketControlFrameQueue.qtest, whose test server withholds flow-control
    credit; the HTTP/3 wait is not tested with a session, as that server is HTTP/2 only and no HTTP/3 server in the
    tests withholds credit from a client stream.
